    "checkout": "bf4075b0a2e8092b04b726c59a7b085d5a37e6f6",
    "note": "phoneDSH-only JSON-RPC conformance vector; no dsh-bot upstream file exists. The checkout records the pinned upstream batch this contract sits beside, not the origin of these cases."
  },
  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "P05/P26: /mcp JSON-RPC bodies are frozen from the Swift handler: initialize version echo and capabilities, ping {}, tools/list native append with Bot-name collision wins, tools/call BotMCPCallResult and unknown_tool failure, -32601/-32602/-32603, batch reply order and 202 notification handling (PC-20261113-bot-mcp-d13).",
    "P05: native forwarding is part of the same endpoint: initialize merges non-empty native instructions, tools/list appends undeclared native names, tools/call forwards non-Bot names unchanged with the original headers, other methods are forwarded before -32601, and notifications are never forwarded.",
    "P05: the HTTP envelope is frozen with exact status/body pairs for origin, bearer, method, target, size, JSON and batch-frame failures; /mcp/native still buffers and is not a streaming route (GAP-36)."
  ],
  "protocolVersions": [
    "2025-11-25",
    "2025-06-18",
    "2025-03-26"
  ],
  "maximumBodyBytes": 1048576,
